        "id": "transfer_brief",
        "kind": "functional_diagram",
        "title": "Synthetic transfer test declaration",
        "edition": "1",
        "uri": "urn:fixture:transfer:1",
        "locator": "Lines 1-6",
        "content": "Environment reconstruction fixture; supplied declarations are not engineering approval.\r\nThe movement is personnel. All three explicit doors permit personnel in both directions.\r\nA local ISO 8 region is declared; GMP grade is unknown and no equivalence is inferred.\r\nProduction uses handover; maintenance and replacement require handover stopped.\r\nDeclared pressures are source 30 Pa, target 20 Pa, upper 10 Pa on a common reference.\r\nEach required pressure difference is at least 10 Pa. Measured values and HVAC evidence are unknown.\r\n",
        "sha256": "25700f865abfd216d1a49e64d92532ee216d598f3c51d243efa3c5103acb98b8",
